{"unit_id": "tag:04MS:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n概形（scheme）的维数（dimension）就是其底层拓扑空间（topological space）的维数（dimension）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "本节考察维数的对象。"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数", "context": "概形的维数。"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "概形的底层空间。"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数", "context": "底层拓扑空间的维数。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:04MT:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <TEXTITOPEN_0001>维数（dimension）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>对<MATH_0002>而言，就是<MATH_0003>作为拓扑空间（topological spaces）的维数（dimension），见《拓扑学（Topology）》的定义<REF_0001>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 对于<MATH_0004>，记<MATH_0005>为<MATH_0006>的底层拓扑空间（topological space）在（at）<MATH_0007>处的维数（dimension），如《拓扑学（Topology）》的定义<REF_0002>所述。\n称<MATH_0008>为<TEXTITOPEN_0002><MATH_0009>在（at）<MATH_0010>处的维数（dimension）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数"}, {"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "at", "target_term": "在"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}, {"source_term": "at", "target_term": "在"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "定义所设的对象。"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数", "context": "第一项中定义的概形维数。"}, {"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "指定用来定义概形维数的空间结构，保留原文词形。"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数", "context": "第一项中将该对象视作拓扑空间所得的维数。"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学", "context": "引用拓扑空间维数定义的章节。"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "第二项中概形的底层空间。"}, {"source_term": "at", "target_term": "在", "context": "与后置的「处」配合，标明底层空间维数所取的点。"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数", "context": "第二项中底层拓扑空间在指定点处的维数。"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学", "context": "引用拓扑空间在一点处的维数定义的章节。"}, {"source_term": "at", "target_term": "在", "context": "与后置的「处」配合，标明概形维数所取的点。"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数", "context": "第二项中命名的概形在指定点处的维数。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:04MS:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n由于概形（scheme）的底层拓扑空间（topological space）是清醒（sober）的（见《概形（Schemes）》的引理<REF_0001>），我们可以这样计算<MATH_0001>的维数（dimension）：取长度（lengths）<MATH_0002>的上确界（supremum），其中链（chains）<MATH_0003>由<MATH_0004>的不可约（irreducible）闭子集（closed subsets）组成；或者取长度（lengths）<MATH_0005>的上确界（supremum），其中特化（specializations）链（chains）<MATH_0006>由<MATH_0007>的点（points）组成。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "sober", "target_term": "清醒"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数"}, {"source_term": "lengths", "target_term": "长度"}, {"source_term": "supremum", "target_term": "上确界"}, {"source_term": "chains", "target_term": "链"}, {"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约"}, {"source_term": "closed subsets", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "lengths", "target_term": "长度"}, {"source_term": "supremum", "target_term": "上确界"}, {"source_term": "specializations", "target_term": "特化"}, {"source_term": "chains", "target_term": "链"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "其底层空间具有所述性质的对象。"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "概形的底层空间。"}, {"source_term": "sober", "target_term": "清醒", "context": "底层拓扑空间具有的性质。"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引用所指的章节。"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数", "context": "用链的长度计算的量。"}, {"source_term": "lengths", "target_term": "长度", "context": "第一种计算方式中各链的长度。"}, {"source_term": "supremum", "target_term": "上确界", "context": "对第一种链的长度所取的界。"}, {"source_term": "chains", "target_term": "链", "context": "由不可约闭子集组成的链。"}, {"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约", "context": "第一种链中闭子集须满足的性质。"}, {"source_term": "closed subsets", "target_term": "闭子集", "context":